{"version":1,"content":"<p>新皇崗口岸今早（12日）6時半開通，整體秩序良好。</p><p>保安局回覆本報表示，截至今午5時，共約4.2萬人次經皇崗口岸出入境，較舊皇崗口岸（落馬洲管制站）9月每周一平均出入境人數增逾一倍。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T16:19:52.478421+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T15:29:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T01:17:51.741595+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T16:17:53.182503+00:00","content_hash":"aab7ae9c441c02dd1a50014ef762bcf9161c67bd7f26857bea19020ae3051856","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}